  message: "Done across 4 PRs (fix-types: cli+sketch core; lang-analyzers+axis_drift; tracker sync_log/models/tui; + earlier build_target/taint/analyzer_identity). Canonical per-package None-safety census — the item's own repro, matching CI's 'for mod in packages/*/src/*/; mypy $mod' loop — is now 0 union-attr + 0 attr-defined across all 6 Python packages (was ~80 at F1 landing; 45 union-attr + 35 attr-defined). Each finding triaged, not blanket-silenced: asserts documenting guarded invariants mypy can't narrow across an intermediate boolean (taint_catalog, cached_results, tag_node, tree=ast.Module); real defensive None-guards where a value genuinely can be None (parser._subparsers, node.parent); honest type corrections (TextIO, TreeNode, dataclasses.fields, ast.stmt, (node.text or b'')); isinstance narrows for ast-walk nodes and the decorator name value; type:ignore reserved ONLY for true typeshed stub gaps (argparse _ChoicesPseudoAction dynamic attrs, PackageMetadata.get). No behavior change in any PR. Filing a separate DRY follow-up for the 14 identical _get_node_text copies surfaced during the analyzer sweep."  # e54b
